---
import Button from './Button.astro';
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero__inner">
    <h1 class="hero__title">A sandbox your coding agent <em>can’t</em> leak out of.</h1>
    <p class="hero__sub">
      Full access, zero secrets. Spin up an isolated, reproducible pod - your agent fully authed,
      and not one vendor secret inside it.
    </p>
    <p class="hero__wit">Every secret stays out of the pod - especially the ones you forgot you had.</p>
    <div class="hero__cta">
      <Button href="/cloud" variant="primary">Start free</Button>
      <Button href="/docs" variant="ghost">Self-host it <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></Button>
    </div>
    <p class="hero__meta">
      <strong>We run it all in the cloud</strong> - broker, vault, and pods, nothing for you to
      operate. Or self-host the open source; the same guarantee either way.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .hero { padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6.5rem) var(--space-section); }
  .hero__title { font-size: var(--fs-hero); max-width: 16ch; margin: 1rem 0 0; }
  .hero__title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }
  .hero__sub { font-size: var(--fs-lead); color: var(--muted); max-width: 52ch; margin: 1.4rem 0 0; }
  .hero__wit { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-style: italic; font-size: 1.35rem; color: var(--accent); margin: 1.1rem 0 0; }
  .hero__cta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.85rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .hero__meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 54ch; margin: 1.3rem 0 0; }
  .hero__meta strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
</style>
